<Library LVVersion="21008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">&lt;B&gt;Temperature Thermistor Measurement Library&lt;/B&gt; VIs can be used to initialize, configure, measure and close on user configurable Analog input pins to derive temperature measurements from voltage excited NTC typed Thermistor devices. This library is applicable for TestScale analog input modules and C Series Voltage Input Modules.</Property>
